{
  "bodyHash": "UdNBqCCGt6c=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">理論上，這個模組支援<strong>所有</strong>模組載入器！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">介紹</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">在 Minecraft 1.19 及更新版本中，如果沒有任何存檔，點擊「單人遊戲」按鈕時，Minecraft 會<strong>自動開啟「建立新世界」畫面</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">如果載入許多模組，上述過程可能會非常緩慢，導致不小心點到這個按鈕的使用者必須等待漫長的幾秒鐘。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這個模組讓 Minecraft 在沒有現有存檔時，<strong>顯示一個空的世界選擇列表畫面</strong>，就像 1.19 之前的版本一樣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">展示</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">當你點擊「單人遊戲」且沒有任何存檔時：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">未安裝模組：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/151/2023-10-14_23.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">安裝模組後：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/152/2023-10-14_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意事項</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<strong style=\"color:#9c0\">絕對可以</strong>將此模組加入您的模組包；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本專案遵循 <strong>Nova Relay 許可證 1.0</strong>。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
